# ---------------- Turret.events (Task 16 Part A: still + face) ----------------
# A rooted turret (enemy type "Turret" gives it Speed 0). `still` stops any walking move and
# keeps it turned toward the nearest player, so it tracks the player without ever chasing —
# which is exactly TK4's stationary gun.

when me appears
  enemy type "Turret"
  still
  face nearest player

# Stay aimed at the player whenever it is in sight.
when me sees player by my SightDistance
  face nearest player

# Fire only while parked and aiming at something.
when every 2 seconds
  me is still
  spawn Bullet at me offset 30
